WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:05.860
Most SAT prep comes down to a tutor,
a stack of practice tests,

2
00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:07.400
and hoping it's working.

3
00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:10.040
At Lighthouse Prep,
you don't have to hope.

4
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.520
You can see it.

5
00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:15.550
Lighthouse Prep is
one-on-one SAT coaching,

6
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:19.280
built around a portal that follows
every step of your student's progress.

7
00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:20.640
Here's how it works.

8
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:25.080
It starts with a full-length diagnostic,
taken right in the portal.

9
00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:27.520
It's built like the real digital SAT.

10
00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:31.310
Timed, adaptive modules,
a built-in graphing calculator,

11
00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:33.880
the reference sheet,
even highlighting and notes.

12
00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:37.960
And every answer saves as they go,
so nothing is ever lost.

13
00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:42.340
When the test is done,
the results go to your coach first.

14
00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:44.970
They walk through them with
your student, one-on-one,

15
00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:47.580
so every number arrives
with an explanation.

16
00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:52.080
Then the portal turns every
answer into a clear picture,

17
00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:57.840
an SAT-equivalent score range,
and a map of all 29 skills the SAT tests,

18
00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:00.860
ranked by where your student
has the most points to gain.

19
00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.560
Every lesson is built around your student.

20
00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:07.290
The portal suggests what
each session should focus on,

21
00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:08.700
based on their latest work.

22
00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:11.920
Your coach reviews it,
adjusts it, and makes the call.

23
00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:14.360
And in every session,

24
00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:17.800
your coach teaches the tips and
tricks that actually move scores.

25
00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:19.740
How to spot the trap answer.

26
00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:22.720
When the graphing calculator
can solve a problem in seconds.

27
00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:25.850
How to pace a module,
so time never runs out.

28
00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:29.340
All aimed squarely at the skills
where your student is struggling.

29
00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:31.650
Before the lesson ends,

30
00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:35.010
your coach can send a few fresh questions
straight to your student's screen,

31
00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:37.540
to make sure the new
strategy really sticks.

32
00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:41.240
After every session
comes targeted homework,

33
00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:44.400
20 questions on exactly
what they just worked on.

34
00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:47.470
In the next session,
coach and student go over it together,

35
00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:49.480
and tag why each miss happened.

36
00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:50.740
Was it the content?

37
00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:51.920
A careless slip?

38
00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:52.790
Timing?

39
00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.400
Or misreading the question?

40
00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:58.320
A skill only moves on once it's mastered.

41
00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:02.240
If it's still a struggle,
it stays the focus, until it clicks.

42
00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:07.340
Along the way, full-length practice tests,
on a steady schedule,

43
00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:10.460
measure real progress
under real test conditions.

44
00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:14.260
And as a parent, you see all of it.

45
00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:18.490
Your dashboard shows the current score,
the target, the days until test day,

46
00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:20.400
and whether your student is on track.

47
00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:23.030
You'll see this week's focus,
every homework set,

48
00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:26.360
and whether it was done on time,
with email reminders along the way.

49
00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:28.460
No guessing, no surprises.

50
00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:31.180
A coach who teaches,

51
00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:35.700
a plan that adapts,
and a portal that shows you everything.

52
00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:37.240
Lighthouse Prep.
